set n to 27.
set steps to 0.
set big to 0.
do the following 200 times.
  if n is more than 1
    set rem to n - n / 2 * 2.
    if rem is 0, halve n.
    otherwise set n to 3 * n + 1.
    add 1 to steps.
    if n is more than big, set big to n.
  that's all.
that's all.
say "steps:" and then steps.
say "highest:" and then big.
